{
  "_comment": [
    "Which guide place carries which tag. Keyed by place name, because the name is already",
    "the guide's primary key: GUIDE_DISTANCES is keyed by it and build-guide.mjs refuses to",
    "write a guide where two places share one.",
    "",
    "Here rather than in a column because neither source can carry it. The sheet has no Tags",
    "column and is spent input (CLAUDE.md R11), and scripts/guide-extra.csv keeps the sheet's",
    "own column shape. One file holds every assignment, so the answer to what is tagged is in",
    "one place whichever source the place came from.",
    "",
    "Every tag must be in src/lib/guide-vocabulary.json and every name must match a place in",
    "the built guide, or the build fails. A rename that silently dropped a place's tags is the",
    "failure both those checks exist to prevent.",
    "",
    "Untagged is normal. A tag is a claim someone checked, not a field to fill: roughly a",
    "third of the guide is tagged and the rest is served perfectly well by its category."
  ],
